      "widgets_values": [
        "Pixel art of a single majestic fire phoenix, a fantasy RPG boss monster sprite. Full body in a dynamic three-quarter battle pose, facing left, wings spread, with every wing tip and tail feather fully inside the frame and generous empty margins. Authentic hand-pixelled late-1990s 16-bit arcade game art. Crisp deliberate square pixel clusters, clean dark outline, strong readable silhouette, rich red, orange and gold feathers, a restrained color palette, stepped highlights and shadows. One isolated character centered on a completely plain pure white background. No text, no UI, no border, no ground plane, no cast shadow."
      ],
      "title": "프롬프트 · 피사체를 바꿔 사용",
